# BUNDLE.manifest — federation-dashboard standalone release bundle (#252)
#
# Lists every repo-relative path that must be included in the install-ready
# release tarball for this component. Consumed by `tools/make-dashboard-bundle.sh`.
#
# Syntax:
#   - One path per line (repo-relative, POSIX separators).
#   - Directory entries end with `/` and are copied recursively.
#   - Lines starting with `#` are comments.
#   - Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Rules for editing:
#   - Every path MUST exist at bundling time (the bundler fails if one is missing).
#   - Paths MUST be inside `federation-dashboard/`. Federation-specific files
#     (any `dev-apprenticeship/` or `tools/` path) and contributor-only tooling
#     (`tools/colony-lint.sh`, `tools/check-*.sh`, `tools/test-*.sh`,
#     `tools/new-colony.sh`), repo-developer docs (`CLAUDE.md`), and CI config
#     (`.github/`) are explicitly excluded by `tools/test-make-dashboard-bundle.sh`.

# ----- The component itself -----
federation-dashboard/
